EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PTT_0000020> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PTT_0000010>))

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PTT_0000021> (Part of yolk)

